{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに来て下さった方はわかると思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日！サプライズ発表がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんのじゃんけん大会であった、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小嶋陽菜さんと乃木坂のコラボが\nなんと、メンバーも追加して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『風の螺旋』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っという曲名でAKB48さんのカップリング曲で出させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲調も振り付けも可愛らしくなってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見れなかったかたは是非AKBさんのカップリングなど次のきかいをお楽しみにしててくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか今回のアンダーライブは\n田中投手や指原莉乃さん、小嶋陽菜さん......などなど沢山の方が見に来てくれてほんとにうれしっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓乃木坂はいつも楽屋が広いのに、\n狭いところに皆で固まる特徴があります！↓証拠写メ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(生駒ちゃん以外の１期生こじ坂メンバーで、１つのソファーに皆でぎゅうぎゅうに座ったり膝の上にいたりしてますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ね\n仕事の現場で歯磨きしようと思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歯磨き粉もって歯磨きしに行ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歯磨き粉じゃなくて化粧水片手にもっててびっくりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね、まあやが水だしっぱなしにしちゃってたのね？\nそしたらせいらりんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『止めなさい(*_*)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていって、止めてくれたのね？\nそれでまあやが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『はい！ごめんなさぁいっ(*_*)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていった瞬間！止めた水を無意識にまた流しちゃって......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近和田は頭が回ってないみたいで\nトイレとお風呂間違えたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶を自分のを話してる間に\n2コップ分ついでたり......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯食べるのに、お箸を２膳だしてたり......(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか頭が回ってないみたいです......(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前仕事の空き時間に\nアミとラーメン食べに行きました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんにも大食いっていうことを隠してたのにライブでばらされちゃいました......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからラーメンまあやは大盛り頼んで平らげました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、ほんと食べ盛りなのかな......？苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中の車でも楽屋でも......ずぅぅぅぅっとモグモグしてます！\nそしてまあやの鞄にはほとんど全部お菓子などの食べ物しか入ってません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校も飲食OKなので、\n毎時間モグモグモグモグしてます......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそう！\nラーメン食べてたら新曲\n『何度目の青空か？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が流れたの〜そしたら二人とも無意識に指先とか動いちゃって踊っちゃって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人で爆笑しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10th！今回も皆様のおかげで一位をとることができました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブで\n団扇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前入りタオル"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやTシャツ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけるとほんと幸せhappyですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前、ステージ裏から聞こえる皆の声援にもメンバー皆元気もらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブあとメンバーがハケた時に聞こえる拍手もめっちゃ嬉しいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の握手会も楽しみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風大丈夫でしたか？(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/15/8299628/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}